= Anna Siemsen

Anna Siemsen is [? if chancellor = "Siemsen": the current Chancellor and ?][? if president = "Siemsen": the current President and ?] an educational reform advocate and pacifist, who was one of the few German women to receive a PhD in the pre-war period. She was a former member of the USPD.

